[0.003472,"o","No existing configuration found — running first-time setup.\r\nConfiguration Location\r\nConfig file:  /tmp/hermes-ui-rust-nxbm8acr/config.yaml\r\nSecrets file: /tmp/hermes-ui-rust-nxbm8acr/.env\r\nData folder:  /tmp/hermes-ui-rust-nxbm8acr\r\nInstall dir:  /home/runner/work/hermes-rust-version/hermes-rust-version/crates/hermes-cli\r\nYou can edit these files directly or use 'hermes config edit'\r\n\r\n"]
[0.006387,"o","Tip: jump straight to a section with 'hermes setup model|terminal|gateway|tools|agent', or fill only missing items with --quick.\r\nPress Enter to keep it, or type a new value to change it.\r\n\r\n\r\nTerminal Backend\r\nChoose where Hermes runs shell commands and code.\r\n   Docker only for now; Modal, SSH, Daytona, and Singularity are not wired yet.\r\n\u001b[?25l\u001b[38;5;10m?\u001b[39m Select terminal backend:  \r\n\u001b[38;5;14m>\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;14mTerminal backend: Local — Commands run directly on this machine.\u001b[39m\r\n  Terminal backend: Docker\r\n\u001b[38;5;14m[\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;14m↑↓ to move, enter to select, type to filter\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;14m]\u001b[39m\r\u001b[3A\u001b[27C\u001b[?25h"]
